{
  "essay": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<p><strong>Jakarta ACC shall</strong> transfer surveillance </p><ol><li><p>identification to Medan East TMA within </p></li><li><p>surveillance coverage accepting unit before 300 nm until 150 nm of DES VOR</p></li></ol><p></p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<p>Jakarta ACC shall transfer surveillance identification to Medan west TMA within surveillance coverage accepting unit before 200 nm until 100 nm of BAC VOR.</p>",
      "value": 4,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T07:41:56.683Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T09:49:36.988Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<ol><li><p>QQQQQ</p></li><li><p>ADDFAFA4</p></li></ol><p>Mengapa balanala?</p><p></p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<p><em>Oafafaf</em> <strong>baiklah</strong></p>",
      "value": 3,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T07:58:56.921Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T07:58:56.921Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<p>Where will the transfer of communications transferred by Jakarta ACC to Singapore ACC for westbound traffic i.g MAS774 RPLL to WMKK via ATS route G580 at<strong> FL 400?</strong></p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<p>at waypoint DOWON</p>",
      "value": 7,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T07:59:53.212Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T07:59:53.212Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<p>Regarding LOCA Jakarta ACC and Ch<strong>ennai ACC, estima</strong>te shall be passed for all flight crossing the common FIR boundary to the appropriate accepting<em> ATS Unit at least ..</em>......... before the aircraft is estimate to pass the TCP.</p><p></p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<p>Jakarta ACC UPLB, estimate time arrival WIPB (Selampari Airport), to Palembang TMA</p>",
      "value": 8,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T08:00:41.522Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T08:00:41.522Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<p>Pre Coordination Level ( PCL ) with Kuala Lumpur for Aircraft destination to Kuala Lumpur via : A. PUGER ( P574 and R461) B. SALAX ( N563) are.....</p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<p>into aerodrome in Batam, tanjungpinang, Johor and Singapore</p>",
      "value": 7,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T08:01:07.297Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T08:01:07.297Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<p>Accoording TLI ( Temporary Local Instruction ) Jakarta ACC and MEDAN APP , when Jakarta ACC shall transfer surveillance identification to Medan East TMA within surveillance coverage accepting unit …</p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<p>Jakarta ACC shall transfer surveillance identification to Medan west TMA within surveillance coverage accepting unit before 200 nm until 100 nm of BAC VOR.</p>",
      "value": 8,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T08:01:41.078Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T08:01:41.078Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<p>What shall Jakarta ACC provide to Tanjungpinang APP for arrival aircraft to aerodrome under responsibility of TANJUNG PINANG APP?</p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<ul><li><p>ATS Direct Speech circuit; </p></li><li><p>Long distance call - SLJJ; </p></li><li><p> AFTN/AMHS; </p></li><li><p>Dedicated Mobile Phone Number.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
      "value": 8,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T08:02:04.342Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T08:14:06.517Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "branchUnitId": 5,
      "question": "<p>Pekanbaru shall not request approval of ATC Clearance to Jakarta ACC regarding aircraft departing Pekanbaru entering Singapore FIR via....and....</p>",
      "image": "",
      "answer": "<p>starting descent and before passing FL290</p>",
      "value": 4,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T08:02:32.581Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-03T08:02:32.581Z",
      "deletedAt": null
